        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Neuter Master</strong> — a lighthearted roguelite-meets-casual game where breeding animals, matching them on a grid, and giving the occasional <i>snip</i> are all part of the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses year by year, with each year divided into four distinct seasons:<br><strong>Spring</strong> – Unlock new tiles, activate fresh grid matches, and get ready for the summer rush.<br><strong>Summer</strong> – Send your animals into the field, let them mingle freely, and see what kind of offspring they produce!<br><strong>Autumn</strong> – Collect gold from your lineup, trigger slot-machine-style match bonuses, and pick powerful roguelike rewards.<br><strong>Winter</strong> – Manage your herd: feed them, sterilize “problem” animals, or… send them into permanent retirement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match animals on a customizable grid to earn gold. Three in a row? Jackpot! Spend your gold to buy new animals or tiles, and breed your way to legendary traits through inheritance and surprising mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over-the-top cartoon visuals, diverse animal traits, and endless breeding combinations, every year becomes a chaotic yet strategic experiment in genetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become the ultimate <strong>Neuter Master</strong>?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Neuter Master</strong> — a lighthearted roguelite-meets-casual game where breeding animals, matching them on a grid, and giving the occasional <i>snip</i> are all part of the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses year by year, with each year divided into four distinct seasons:<br><strong>Spring</strong> – Unlock new tiles, activate fresh grid matches, and get ready for the summer rush.<br><strong>Summer</strong> – Send your animals into the field, let them mingle freely, and see what kind of offspring they produce!<br><strong>Autumn</strong> – Collect gold from your lineup, trigger slot-machine-style match bonuses, and pick powerful roguelike rewards.<br><strong>Winter</strong> – Manage your herd: feed them, sterilize “problem” animals, or… send them into permanent retirement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match animals on a customizable grid to earn gold. Three in a row? Jackpot! Spend your gold to buy new animals or tiles, and breed your way to legendary traits through inheritance and surprising mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over-the-top cartoon visuals, diverse animal traits, and endless breeding combinations, every year becomes a chaotic yet strategic experiment in genetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become the ultimate <strong>Neuter Master</strong>?</p>",
        "short_description": "A lighthearted roguelite breeding game where you match animals on a customizable grid, earn gold with slot-machine-style combos, and balance breeding, sterilizing, and upgrades to keep your herd thriving year after year.",
